{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you navigate the deadly course and secure a high score in this precision platformer / coin runner game? Invert gravity and jump to explore your way through a gauntlet of hazards collecting coins and big bonuses. A limited version of two of three modes of play available.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Undying - explore three (of the final 10) sections to the end only losing score when you hit hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merciless - (Full-release only) Endless mode where hazards will remove health. Get too greedy and your run is cut short. Difficulty increases as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speedrun - A one minute teaser size speed course where picking up coins speeds you up and jumping slows you slightly. Compete for the best time through the course.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Earn Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637870/extras/reward_choices.gif?t=1744066346\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect coins to fill the combo meter on the left. Once full take your choice of 3 rewards to enhance the run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Speed Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637870/extras/speed_run.gif?t=1744066346\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accelerate faster and faster as you collect coins. Use gravity shift as often as possible because jumping will slow you down. Hitting hazards resets your speed entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637870?t=1744066346","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637870/e18b633a1c4b93ceff8108b07c22ee906dc02324/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744066346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/